WEBVTT


00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:17.740
<i>The events leading up to my death
were a lot like the rest of my life.</i>


00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.906
<i>Things didn't go
exactly as planned.</i>


00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:27.011
<i>If you asked me what the odds
in an amateur hanging</i>


00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:30.247
<i>going off without a hitch were,
I'd say about one in three.</i>


00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.359
<i>A few things can happen.
Put the noose too high?</i>


00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.585
<i>Swing for hours.</i>


00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.257
<i>Too low?</i>


00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:39.922
<i>Choke for minutes.</i>


00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.926
<i>But hit that sweet spot,
the neck'll snap just so.</i>


00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.928
<i>One in three.</i>


00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.281
Okay...


00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.108
...one in four.


00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.391
<i>I was born a gambler.</i>


00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.464
<i>Cards, dice,</i>


00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.294
<i>sports, horses.</i>


00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.467
<i>I'd bet on anything if
the odds were right.</i>


00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:21.471
<i>But now I've lost a bet
that cost me more than money.</i>


00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.905
<i>It's cost me my family.</i>


00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.173
<i>My family defies all odds.</i>


00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.076
<i>Five kids; all boys.</i>


00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.012
<i>The odds in that?</i>


00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:32.675
<i>One in 16.</i>


00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.686
<i>Five boys from three
different women?</i>


00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.312
<i>One in 300.</i>


00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.687
<i>Staying married to my first wife
through that?</i>


00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.261
<i>Somewhere south of zero.</i>


00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.996
<i>That's my eldest son, Nuts.</i>


00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.995
<i>Born during a heat wave.</i>


00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:53.533
<i>His mother says
that's what gives him his temper,</i>


00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:57.666
<i>but... I think the kid was born
with a sour disposition.</i>


00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.537
<i>Nuts wasn't one for school.</i>


00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.707
<i>All he ever wanted to
be was a pro boxer.</i>


00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:07.217
<i>But... well...</i>


00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.844
<i>things didn't go exactly as planned.</i>


00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.682
<i>That's my second boy, Cal.</i>


00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:17.223
<i>Poor kid inherited
my weakness for women.</i>


00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:21.356
<i>I knew pretty early on when he found a way
to join an all-girls prep school.</i>


00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.192
<i>Now that one cost
me a small fortune.</i>


00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:30.036
<i>Come Christmas, he shows up
with a different gal each year.</i>


00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:33.205
<i>And let's just say he's got a type.</i>


00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.213
<i>After Cal came my third boy, Jacob.</i>


00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:41.682
<i>Smart, organized.</i>


00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:44.480
<i>Holds down a real job.</i>


00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:48.160
<i>Huh. Y'know,
when you say it all together like that,</i>


00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.728
<i>makes me wonder if
he's mine after all.</i>


00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.389
<i>Now, I'm no saint.</i>


00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:58.431
<i>Fact is, I'd probably catch on fire
if I ever did step foot in church.</i>


00:03:58.571 --> 00:03:59.970
<i>So long story short:</i>


00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.733
<i>her name was Champagne.</i>


00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:06.572
<i>And nine months later, boy number four
shows up on my doorstep.</i>


00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:09.745
<i>The kid's got a lot of heart.</i>


00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.084
<i>Everyone calls him Juicebox
because, well...</i>


00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:16.085
<i>...I wouldn't call a kid slow, but...</i>


00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.084
<i>... well, he's got a big heart.</i>


00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.621
<i>Goldie forgave me for Champagne.</i>


00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.820
<i>But you know what they say:</i>


00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.124
<i>fool me once, shame on you.</i>


00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:28.928
<i>Fool me twice, you're divorced.</i>


00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:31.801
<i>Sometimes life throws
you a curve ball.</i>


00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.937
<i>A tiny, Vietnamese curve ball.</i>


00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:39.939
<i>After what became colourfully known
as the Saigon Incident,</i>


00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:42.138
<i>Goldie, quite understandably, left me.</i>


00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:45.342
<i>But she never stopped
being a good mom to the boys,</i>


00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:47.453
<i>even the ones that weren't hers.</i>


00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.281
<i>And that's my family.</i>


00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:52.785
<i>The most unlikely bunch
you'll ever chance upon.</i>


00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:58.287
<i>And seeing as I'd sooner die
than see any harm come to them...</i>


00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:03.625
<i>...today's gonna be
the last day of my life.</i>


00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:10.333
<i>The odds of surviving
a trip over Niagara Falls are long.</i>


00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:11.966
<i>It's happened exactly once.</i>


00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.671
<i>Back in '53, some kid lucked out.</i>


00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:18.842
<i>But he had an adult-sized life jacket on,
so I'm not sure it counts.</i>


00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:23.088
<i>Now that's not to knock
what the lil' tiger went through,</i>


00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:26.214
<i>but a boy that small
in a life jacket that big?</i>


00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.327
<i>The kid's practically a fuckin' pontoon.</i>


00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:35.164
<i>But I don't want to
beat the odds here.</i>


00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.161
<i>For once,
I want them stacked against me.</i>


00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:44.006
<i>Just like I stacked them
against my oldest boys.</i>


00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.837
<i>So I need a miracle.</i>


00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:51.005
<i>For my family.</i>


00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:57.346
<i>For fate to erase the weight
of all my misdeeds.</i>


00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.682
<i>A reversal of fortune.</i>


00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:04.686
<i>A resurrection.</i>


00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:09.699
<i>A real, bona-fide miracle.</i>


00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:16.868
<i>But I don't believe in miracles.</i>


00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:31.247
<i>I know that it's time</i>


