00:13:33.145 --> 00:13:36.376
Your mother was a good woman.
Juicy's, too.


00:13:36.515 --> 00:13:38.312
Even Soo Ling wasn't that bad.


00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:43.846
And, most of all, I should've led a life
