00:33:19.630 --> 00:33:21.530
Eddie White. Twelve and 0.


00:33:21.666 --> 00:33:23.657
Never fought above the undercard.


00:33:23.801 --> 00:33:25.428
Never touched the canvas.


00:33:25.570 --> 00:33:28.869
