01:22:36.685 --> 01:22:39.176
Well, then I'm not so sure... now.


01:22:39.788 --> 01:22:40.812
Uh...


01:22:40.956 --> 01:22:44.084
I-I-I'm just....
I'm looking for a sign, is all.


01:22:56.237 --> 01:22:57.898
- Well, don't wait forever.


01:22:58.306 --> 01:22:59.830
Life's short.
- Ha!


01:22:59.975 --> 01:23:01.533
Yeah, that's very true.


01:23:10.352 --> 01:23:11.512
- Help!!!


01:23:12.320 --> 01:23:14.015
- That's very true. Okay.


01:23:14.155 --> 01:23:15.986
Uh... fuck it.


01:23:16.491 --> 01:23:17.651
Here goes.


01:23:22.364 --> 01:23:23.422
Miranda...


01:23:30.505 --> 01:23:31.665
- C'mon...


01:23:35.877 --> 01:23:38.243
- C'mon! C'mon!


01:23:39.681 --> 01:23:41.171
- Will you...


01:23:42.951 --> 01:23:44.282
- Oh, my God.


01:23:55.030 --> 01:23:57.863
Today is the 14th day
since the end of my life.


01:24:02.037 --> 01:24:04.028
Now, I don't believe in miracles.


01:24:04.706 --> 01:24:06.196
I believe in odds.


01:24:07.876 --> 01:24:09.707
And if you forced my bet...


01:24:10.545 --> 01:24:12.877
...I'd wager I'm straight-up dead.


01:24:14.382 --> 01:24:18.546
And that this is one of those "life flashes
before your eyes" moments.


01:24:19.220 --> 01:24:21.450
Like a dream you swear lasted months,


01:24:21.589 --> 01:24:24.888
even though you knew
you just slept for an hour.


01:24:25.393 --> 01:24:28.851
Or maybe a clever trick
your brain plays on your body


01:24:28.997 --> 01:24:31.557
to ease that painful,
permanent fade to black...


01:24:32.400 --> 01:24:34.265
... wrapping your head in warm thoughts


01:24:34.402 --> 01:24:37.599
so you don't feel
the cold, hard hand of death.


01:24:37.739 --> 01:24:39.229
But I saw things.


01:24:40.308 --> 01:24:42.333
I saw my resurrection.


01:24:43.912 --> 01:24:45.402
And this is what I saw.


01:24:47.415 --> 01:24:49.645
I saw a slip of the noose


01:24:49.784 --> 01:24:51.752
and it's off like a torpedo.


01:24:51.886 --> 01:24:54.912
And when that giant man-pedo
decides to surface...


01:24:55.924 --> 01:24:58.085
... well, I saw a sight to behold.


01:24:58.927 --> 01:25:01.259
I saw my boy one last time.


01:25:01.396 --> 01:25:04.229
- I'm looking for a sign.
- My reckless son.


01:25:04.365 --> 01:25:06.833
And I knew...
- Miranda...


01:25:07.802 --> 01:25:08.962
-...for once in my life...


01:25:09.437 --> 01:25:10.995
- Will you...?


01:25:13.341 --> 01:25:15.502
<i>...I was there for him.</i>


01:25:29.290 --> 01:25:30.780
That was a sign!


01:25:32.293 --> 01:25:33.783
I gotta go.


01:25:38.633 --> 01:25:40.294
<i>Then I saw my eldest.</i>


01:25:40.969 --> 01:25:44.564
<i>And I was flooded by thoughts
of all the wrong I did to him.</i>


01:25:46.708 --> 01:25:50.007
<i>Now, a dead body
floating in the water</i>


01:25:50.145 --> 01:25:52.841
<i>miles away
can't possibly save my wayward son.</i>


01:25:52.981 --> 01:25:55.677
<i>But if a concerned tourist
happened to call 911...</i>


01:25:57.051 --> 01:26:01.112
<i>...and if the ambulance sent
to fish a bloated corpse out of the water</i>


01:26:01.256 --> 01:26:04.521
<i>happened to skid off the road
and into a hydro pole...</i>


01:26:05.326 --> 01:26:08.386
<i>...well, then my wayward son
suddenly stands a fighting chance.</i>


01:26:15.837 --> 01:26:17.702
<i>I saw my boy...</i>


01:26:17.839 --> 01:26:20.535
<i>and a weight came
off my heavy heart.</i>


01:26:21.676 --> 01:26:23.166
<i>Like I could float.</i>


01:26:24.512 --> 01:26:26.309
<i>Like the impossible
was made possible.</i>


01:26:30.185 --> 01:26:33.052
<i>And just when I thought
I could feel no more joy,</i>


01:26:33.188 --> 01:26:34.678
<i>I saw something else.</i>


01:26:35.523 --> 01:26:37.184
<i>My other boy.</i>


01:26:37.325 --> 01:26:38.849
<i>The one I never understood.</i>


01:26:42.697 --> 01:26:45.860
<i>The odds in surviving the falls
are a million to one.</i>


01:26:46.534 --> 01:26:48.695
<i>And I saw those odds beat.</i>


01:26:50.538 --> 01:26:54.201
<i>I saw a twist of fate
that can only be called a miracle.</i>


01:26:59.214 --> 01:27:00.909
<i>I saw that noose...</i>


01:27:01.049 --> 01:27:02.539
<i>catch that barrel...</i>


01:27:05.553 --> 01:27:09.045
<i>...and I knew that the odds
just didn't matter anymore.</i>


01:27:11.559 --> 01:27:13.891
<i>It's something more
than impossible.</i>


01:27:17.065 --> 01:27:19.056
<i>More than the odds can allow.</i>


01:27:24.572 --> 01:27:26.062
<i>And then I saw the future.</i>


01:27:33.581 --> 01:27:35.242
<i>And it was cloudier still.</i>


01:27:39.254 --> 01:27:40.744
<i>But I know what I saw.</i>


01:27:45.093 --> 01:27:47.926
<i>And I was basking in a light
I didn't deserve.</i>


01:27:51.933 --> 01:27:53.594
<i>For I saw a miracle.</i>


01:27:58.273 --> 01:28:01.265
<i>It was so close,
it was like I was there.</i>


01:28:05.280 --> 01:28:06.941
<i>Like I was part of it.</i>


01:28:11.953 --> 01:28:13.944
<i>Like I could almost touch it.</i>


01:28:19.627 --> 01:28:21.618
<i>I saw the lives of my boys.</i>


01:28:26.134 --> 01:28:27.624
<i>My family.</i>


01:28:33.474 --> 01:28:37.137
<i>Fate erasing the stain
of all my misdeeds.</i>


01:28:41.816 --> 01:28:44.478
<i>And I knew everything
was going to be okay.</i>


01:28:49.324 --> 01:28:51.485
<i>For I had a reversal of fortune.</i>


01:28:55.997 --> 01:28:57.487
<i>A resurrection.</i>


01:29:01.502 --> 01:29:03.333
<i>A bona-fide miracle.</i>


01:29:09.677 --> 01:29:13.010
<i>And I was so happy,
I knew I must be dead.</i>


